  "details": "I think it would be a worthwhile feature to include \"Use Default Safety settings\" Or disable Avatars that are instance specific. for times that you turn everybody's avatars on and it starts to bog down.  Or if you frequent instances in which you've seen people before. Rather than manually selecting the avatars and turning them off. \n\nI'm not referring to already in place safety settings, I'm talking about after the fact of using these settings and manually turning on avatars. It would also offer a kill switch for someone who is in a possible crashing avatar or bright flashing lights and not knowing where it's coming from.",
